    <section id="sect-00011">
      <list id="list-00008">
        <item>Solve linear equations using a general strategy.</item>
        <item>Classify equations.</item>
        <item>Identify points on a graph.</item>
      </list>
      <para id="para-00067">If you are still struggling, be sure to reach out to your teacher for additional help. Nobody is good at problems like
        this on the first try. Keep at it, and it will get easier.</para>
    </section>
